'''Adaman''' (Japanese: '''セキ''' ''Seki'') is a {{TCGP|Supporter}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Triumphant Light}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Supporter
|rule=SWSH Supporter
|effect=During your opponent's next turn, all of your {{e|Metal}} Pokémon take −20 damage from attacks from your opponent's Pokémon.
}}

