==Trivia==
* This card's effect is similar to {{TCG|Jasmine's Gaze}} in the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]], but decreases damage by 20 instead of 30 and only applies to {{e|Metal}} Pokémon.
** This card's effect is also similar to the {{TCG|Stadium card}} {{TCG|Full Metal Lab}} in the Pokémon Trading Card Game, but this card is a Supporter card that only applies during the next turn, only affects the player's Pokémon, and decreases damage by 20 instead of 30.
** {{TCG|Adaman}} also exists in the Pokémon Trading Card Game, but with a different effect.

===Origin===
*[[Adaman]] is the leader of the [[Diamond Clan]] in [[Pokémon Legends: Arceus]].

